WEBVTT

00:07:59.089 --> 00:08:01.333
Najemajo samo popolne ljudi.

00:08:01.333 --> 00:08:03.810
So pa obstajale izjeme.

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:05.983
Odraščala sem ob gledanju Whoopi Goldberg,

00:08:05.983 --> 00:08:07.919
Roseanne Barr, Ellen.

00:08:07.919 --> 00:08:10.454
Vse te ženske so imele nekaj skupnega:

00:08:10.454 --> 00:08:11.716
bile so komičarke.

00:08:11.716 --> 00:08:14.210
Tako sem postala komičarka.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:18.747
(Smeh) (Aplavz)

00:08:19.858 --> 00:08:23.535
Moje prvo delo je bilo voziti znane komike

00:08:23.535 --> 00:08:26.114
iz New Yorka na nastope v New Jersey.

00:08:26.114 --> 00:08:28.487
Nikoli ne bom pozabila obraza
prvega komika,

00:08:28.487 --> 00:08:30.506
ki sem ga peljala, ko je ugotovil,